OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers guilty of misconduct over
OL,4,Aabuse incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Nottinghamshire Police officers
OL,7,Fhave been found guilty of misconduct
OL,8,Fover their response to a domestic abuse
OL,9,Fincident.
OL,11,FPC Thomas Lee-Storey and former PC Amy
OL,12,FJowett attended an address in St Ann's,
OL,13,FNottingham, on 29 October 2024, when a
OL,14,Fwoman reported she received threats
OL,15,Ffrom her granddaughter.
OL,17,FConcerns were raised about the handling
OL,18,Fof the incident, including a lack of
OL,19,Fsafeguarding and a failure to record
OL,20,Fcrimes, prompting an investigation by
OL,21,Fthe force's professional standards
OL,22,Fdirectorate.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
