OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers guilty of misconduct over
OL,4,Aabuse incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a three-day gross misconduct
OL,7,Fhearing, Lee-Storey was given a
OL,8,Ffive-year final written warning, and it
OL,9,Fwas decided Jowett would have received
OL,10,Fthe same sanction if she had not
OL,11,Falready resigned.
